OL,3,GNEWSAEducation minister cleared over
OL,4,AIsrael trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Education Minister Paul Givan did
OL,7,Fnot breach the ministerial code over a
OL,8,Ftrip to Israel, according to the
OL,9,FAssembly Commissioner for Standards.
OL,11,FThe week-long trip, paid for by the
OL,12,FIsraeli government in October 2025, led
OL,13,Fto a no-confidence motion in Givan in
OL,14,Fthe assembly.
OL,16,FHowever, the motion failed to get
OL,17,Fcross-community support.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
