OL,3,GNEWSAEducation minister cleared over
OL,4,AIsrael trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement following the
OL,7,Fpublication of the commissioner's
OL,8,Freport, Givan accused those behind the
OL,9,Fno-confidence motion of "an attempted
OL,10,Fpolitical lynching".
